saferMake bundles third-party files in inst/app/www, used for the style of
its shiny app. They keep their own copyright and license, listed below. The
rest of the package is under the GPL-3 license (see the DESCRIPTION file).


inst/app/www/theme.css
    Stylesheet of sphinx_rtd_theme, the Read the Docs theme for Sphinx
    (https://github.com/readthedocs/sphinx_rtd_theme).
    Copyright (c) 2013-2018 Dave Snider, Read the Docs, Inc. & contributors
    License: MIT (text below).
    It includes the stylesheet of Font Awesome 4.7.0 (see below).

inst/app/www/fonts/lato-*.woff and lato-*.woff2
    Lato font, version 2.015 (http://www.latofonts.com/).
    Copyright (c) 2011-2015 by tyPoland Lukasz Dziedzic
    (http://www.typoland.com/) with Reserved Font Name "Lato".
    License: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (http://scripts.sil.org/OFL).

inst/app/www/fonts/Roboto-Slab-*.woff and Roboto-Slab-*.woff2
    Roboto Slab font, version 1.100263.
    Font data copyright Google 2013.
    License: Apache License, Version 2.0
    (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

inst/app/www/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.* and the Font Awesome part of theme.css
    Font Awesome 4.7.0 by Dave Gandy (http://fontawesome.io).
    Copyright Dave Gandy 2016.
    License: font under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
    (http://scripts.sil.org/OFL), stylesheet under the MIT License
    (http://fontawesome.io/license).


